  "starterCode": "import numpy as np\n\ndef nadam_step(w: list, m: list, v: list, grad: list, lr: float = 0.002, beta1: float = 0.9, beta2: float = 0.999, eps: float = 1e-8) -> dict:\n    \"\"\"\n    Returns a dictionary with new_w, new_m, and new_v.\n    \"\"\"\n    # Write code here\n    pass",
